arj.com.br/why-choose-earj/mission-vision-purpose", "Norsk"]], "skipped": [["nav @nav.#", 1608], ["[role=menu] @ul.fsNavLevel2#", 1006], ["script @script.#", 423], ["noscript @noscript.#", 412], ["[class*=\"footer\" i] @section.fsElement fsContainer footer-top-contain#fsEl_2806", 343], ["button @button.expander-btn#", 152], ["[role=menubar] @ul.fsNavLevel1#", 85], ["[class*=\"footer\" i] @section.fsElement fsContainer footer-bottom-cont#fsEl_2822", 43]], "sample": "", "role": "sub", "link_label": "Mission, Vision & Purpose", "link_score": 3.5}, {"url": "https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/head-of-school-message", "title": "Head of School Message - Escola Americana Do Rio de Janeiro", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[22, "a", -66, 1, 0, "Skip To Main Content"], [28, "h2", 943, 0, 1, "Head of School Message"], [22, "p", 1079, 0, 0, "At Escola Americana do Rio de Janeiro (EARJ), we are thrilled to welcome you to our vibrant educational community. As a leading international school in Rio de Janeiro, we are committed to providing a world-class education that inspires students to reach their full potential."], [22, "div", 1190, 0, 0, "A Legacy of Excellence:"], [22, "p", 1189, 0, 0, "EARJ was founded in 1937 and boasts a rich history of academic excellence and a strong tradition of providing a high-quality education for students from around the world. Our two modern campuses offer purpose built facilities, including science labs, libraries, art studios, and athletic fields, creating an inspiring and engaging learning environment. We are proud to be an authorized IB World School, offering the full International Baccalaureate (IB) Continuum: Primary Years Programme (PYP), Middle Years Programme (MYP), and Diploma Programme (DP)."], [22, "div", 1480, 0, 0, "A Global Perspective:"], [22, "p", 1449, 0, 0, "EARJ embraces a diverse student body, including both long-term Brazilian families and international expatriates, fostering a truly global and inclusive learning environment. Our dedicated faculty, many of whom are internationally experienced, are passionate about the IB learner profile and committed to providing personalized learning experiences. Students have the opportunity to earn the American Diploma, the Brazilian Diploma and the prestigious IB Diploma."], [22, "div", 1740, 0, 0, "A Focus on Student Growth:"], [22, "p", 1709, 0, 0, "We prioritize a student-centered approach to learning, encouraging critical thinking, creativity, and a love for inquiry. A wide range of extracurricular activities, including sports, arts, and clubs, provides opportunities for students to explore their interests and develop valuable life skills. We equip our students with the knowledge, skills, and global perspectives they need to thrive in an ever-changing world, preparing them for success in college and beyond."], [22, "div", 2000, 0, 0, "Join Our Community"], [22, "p", 1969, 0, 0, "We invite you to explore our website and learn more about the unique opportunities that await your child at EARJ. We are confident that you will find a welcoming and supportive community where your child can flourish."], [22, "p", 2219, 0, 0, "Dr. Steve Desroches Head of School"], [20, "p", 3124, 0, 0, "lEARN MORE"], [13, "a", 862, 1, 0, "English"]], "links": [["https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/head-of-school-message", "Skip To Main Content"], ["https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/head-of-school-message", "WHY CHOOSE EARJ"], ["https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/head-of-school-message", "Head of School Message"], ["https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/mission-vision-purpose", "Mission, Vision & Purpose"], ["https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/who-we-are", "Who We Are"], ["https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/international-accreditations", "International Accreditations"], ["https://www.earj.com.br/why-choose-earj/equal-opportunities-inclusion-and-anti-discrimination", "Equal Opportunities, Inclusion and Anti-Discrimination"], ["https://